    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MASH VP! Re:VISION&quot; is a rhythm game for Steam, built around the concept of &quot;mashups&quot;\u2014a technique used in DJ performances where multiple tracks are blended together to create an entirely new song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong><u>over 150 playable tracks</u></strong> in the base game, including mashup songs, there\u2019s plenty to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, <u><strong>seasonal events</strong></u> like &quot;VIRTUAL PATH&quot; and &quot;GHOST BATTLE Rank Match&quot; offer even more fun long after your purchase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>1. An Extensive Lineup of Tracks</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/436de10285432c866309bede36ef2060.avif?t=1754535618\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tracks from world-renowned artists, including rhythm game legends and top creators from Japan, Korea, and the United States. Plus, tracks featuring popular vocalists add even more variety to the experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Featured Artists (Partial List)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAOKI / Tatsh / EmoCosine / NOMA / RiraN / Sakuzyo / Maozon / xi / TORIENA /</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >onoken / TAG / DJ Noriken / Quarkee / HyuN / SLAKE / Masayoshi Iimori / Nothing But Requiem / \u30b5\u30a4\u30e2\u30f3\u30de\u30f3 / \u5343\u672c\u677e \u4ec1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Featured Vocalists (Partial List)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c0f\u5742\u308a\u3086 / nayuta / \u6708\u4e43 / \u306a\u306a\u3072\u3089 / \u72db\u8309\u7483\u5948</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>2. Recreate Music Through Mashups</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the &quot;MASH UP&quot; Mode, where two tracks combine to form an entirely new song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unique MASH UP mode, where you combine tracks played in FREE PLAY to create completely new songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring out the unique qualities of each track and enjoy a surprising and creative music experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MASH UP Mode, the rhythm and melodies of each song naturally blend together, transforming them into something completely fresh and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/f0772372389e1a5fdeea57457a085aa1.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Popular songs like \u201cBrain Power\u201d and \u201cHalcyon\u201d can also be mashed up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And as you level up, you may even discover a special 3-track mashup featuring &quot;conflict&quot;\u2026!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>3. Innovative Two-Lane System!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a unique &quot;2-Line System&quot;, where notes flow from two separate routes. With just one button, both lines light up, creating an intuitive and immersive gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/85c2a8e645a332fe2e95fdf4c0465c65.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHT MIX: A simple and intuitive two-lane style for beginners.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/5c0fb6de9ccf9b74a04a2c186fa63868.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARD MIX: A challenging and thrilling four-lane style for advanced players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/1b73f7628e1974359e41721fe1e9f608.avif?t=1754535618\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SINGLE LANE Mode has\u00a0also  been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing back the classic music game experience, this is a mode where the lanes are always merged into one single lane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 7 types of charts, from beginner-friendly to advanced levels, you\u2019ll find the perfect way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>4. Earn Rewards in the Content &quot;VIRTUAL PATH&quot;!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete special missions to earn rewards in VIRTUAL PATH, a event system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regularly updated events will let you unlock exclusive rewards and tracks, inspired by the world of the game and special collaborations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/66ce651f585cf5e3084fd7a0b4367f61.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>5.  Intense Battles Await in &quot;GHOST BATTLE&quot;!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against ghost scores generated from player and friend playdata!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friend Match \u2013 Compete against your friends' ghost data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Match \u2013 Challenge random players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank Match \u2013 A seasonal ranking mode where you compete against players of similar skill levels to climb the leaderboard! Earn exclusive rewards based on your final ranking at the end of each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/a8df1ae5a2a13e4ea03ca648e528de0e.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>6. Advanced Customization Support</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Game Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to essential rhythm game options like high-speed settings and judgment timing adjustments, enjoy further options that ensure a comfortable experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/a9a798073ab8e9c6c7e64b98f9fa539a.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift Effect Adjustment: Reduce camera shake and effects in DISPLAY OPTIONS. Whether you prefer full immersion or focused gameplay, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Customization: Configure the key layout for optimal comfort, allowing you to create your own ideal play environment. Controller support is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASIO Audio Output Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At AXTORM, every developer is a passionate rhythm gamer. We understand the importance of audio latency in rhythm games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MASH VP! Re:VISION&quot; uses the FMOD audio engine and supports ASIO audio drivers, enabling low-latency gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a seamless and immersive rhythm game experience with the best responsiveness and sound quality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Now, embark on a journey into a new world of music!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MASH VP! Re:VISION&quot; is a rhythm game for Steam, built around the concept of &quot;mashups&quot;\u2014a technique used in DJ performances where multiple tracks are blended together to create an entirely new song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong><u>over 150 playable tracks</u></strong> in the base game, including mashup songs, there\u2019s plenty to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, <u><strong>seasonal events</strong></u> like &quot;VIRTUAL PATH&quot; and &quot;GHOST BATTLE Rank Match&quot; offer even more fun long after your purchase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>1. An Extensive Lineup of Tracks</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/436de10285432c866309bede36ef2060.avif?t=1754535618\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tracks from world-renowned artists, including rhythm game legends and top creators from Japan, Korea, and the United States. Plus, tracks featuring popular vocalists add even more variety to the experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Featured Artists (Partial List)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAOKI / Tatsh / EmoCosine / NOMA / RiraN / Sakuzyo / Maozon / xi / TORIENA /</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >onoken / TAG / DJ Noriken / Quarkee / HyuN / SLAKE / Masayoshi Iimori / Nothing But Requiem / \u30b5\u30a4\u30e2\u30f3\u30de\u30f3 / \u5343\u672c\u677e \u4ec1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Featured Vocalists (Partial List)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c0f\u5742\u308a\u3086 / nayuta / \u6708\u4e43 / \u306a\u306a\u3072\u3089 / \u72db\u8309\u7483\u5948</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></