b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/5c0fb6de9ccf9b74a04a2c186fa63868.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARD MIX: A challenging and thrilling four-lane style for advanced players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/1b73f7628e1974359e41721fe1e9f608.avif?t=1754535618\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SINGLE LANE Mode has\u00a0also  been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bringing back the classic music game experience, this is a mode where the lanes are always merged into one single lane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 7 types of charts, from beginner-friendly to advanced levels, you\u2019ll find the perfect way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>4. Earn Rewards in the Content &quot;VIRTUAL PATH&quot;!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete special missions to earn rewards in VIRTUAL PATH, a event system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regularly updated events will let you unlock exclusive rewards and tracks, inspired by the world of the game and special collaborations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/66ce651f585cf5e3084fd7a0b4367f61.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>5.  Intense Battles Await in &quot;GHOST BATTLE&quot;!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against ghost scores generated from player and friend playdata!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friend Match \u2013 Compete against your friends' ghost data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Match \u2013 Challenge random players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank Match \u2013 A seasonal ranking mode where you compete against players of similar skill levels to climb the leaderboard! Earn exclusive rewards based on your final ranking at the end of each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/a8df1ae5a2a13e4ea03ca648e528de0e.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>6. Advanced Customization Support</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Game Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to essential rhythm game options like high-speed settings and judgment timing adjustments, enjoy further options that ensure a comfortable experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928330/extras/a9a798073ab8e9c6c7e64b98f9fa539a.avif?t=1754535618\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift Effect Adjustment: Reduce camera shake and effects in DISPLAY OPTIONS. Whether you prefer full immersion or focused gameplay, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Customization: Configure the key layout for optimal comfort, allowing you to create your own ideal play environment. Controller support is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASIO Audio Output Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At AXTORM, every developer is a passionate rhythm gamer. We understand the importance of audio latency in rhythm games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MASH VP! Re:VISION&quot; uses the FMOD audio engine and supports ASIO audio drivers, enabling low-latency gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a seamless and immersive rhythm game experience with the best responsiveness and sound quality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Now, embark on a journey into a new world of music!</strong></i></p>",
